		<td class="row1" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=38050&amp;sid=ffd27f942be9943c81def9d6400ebb3b#38050"><img src="templates/subBlack/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Tue Oct 19, 2004 8:37 pm<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: Recruitment Policy / Current Requirements march 2005</span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=38050&amp;sid=ffd27f942be9943c81def9d6400ebb3b"><img src="templates/subBlack/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Hello! Welcome to the Dawnraiders recruitment section!
<br />

<br />
We're recruiting:
<br />

<br />
Requirements: 
<br />

<br />
- Level 70 
<br />
- Class defining AA 150 min 
<br />
- Clerics - mgb is required and all heal aas maxed, radiant  
<br />
 cure + celestrial regen. 
<br />
- Druids - mgb is required, Spirit of the wood lvl 3, radient cure lvl 3, all heal spells maxed.
<br />
- For tanks - all defensive AA maxed. 
<br />
- Resists 150 min 
<br />
- Shrink and invis items required 
<br />
- Kod'taz flag a must 
<br />
- Be able to raid from the start of a raid to raid end. (Normally 6:30pm GMT to 11pm GMT)
<br />

<br />

<br />
Needed classes 
<br />

<br />
Wizards ** exceptions can be made re flags and gear.
<br />
Clerics
<br />
Bards
<br />
Druids
<br />

<br />
We raid four times per week - we need players that can make at least two, preferably four of these raids per week. The more you can raid, the better your chances of successful application.
<br />

<br />
Our raid targets? We farm Plane of Time weekly, and our next challenge is Uqua, which will open the garden of Qvic to us. We're also active in OoW, mainly RS, WoS and RCoD.
<br />

<br />
If you are not listed in the high priority classes its still worth applying, however it may take a while before a vacancy comes up. Exceptional candidates will always be considered.
<br />

<br />
For info about the guild and recruitment contact an officer
<br />

<br />
Look forward to meeting you...
<br />

<br />
Terienais 
<br />
Recruitment officer</span><span class="gensmall"></span></td>
